# CQ 15: Which variables are carried by no action line?
#
# A variable of 351-42 exists in a model to be acted on or to act. One that no
# line carries is stated and then never used: the model names it and shows no
# place where it flows.
#
# Not always a defect. A disturbance variable acts on a unit from outside the
# chain, 351-42-13, so it is reached by actsOn rather than by a line, and it
# appears here correctly. The role is reported so a reader can tell that case
# from a forgotten connection.
PREFIX iec60050:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?variable ?role
WHERE {
  ?variable a ?role . ?role rdfs:subClassOf* iec60050:VariableQuantity .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?variable a ?narrower .
                      ?narrower rdfs:subClassOf+ ?role ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf* iec60050:VariableQuantity }
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?line iec60050:carriesVariable ?variable }
} ORDER BY ?role ?variable
